    <briefdescription>
<para>W3C Trace Context for correlation ID propagation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>W3C Trace Context for distributed tracing.</para>
<para>Trace context for correlating multi-step operations.</para>
<para>Encodes trace_id, span_id, and sampling decision for propagation across RPC boundaries.</para>
<para>Enables distributed tracing and request correlation across multiple process module operations (import→validate→link).</para>
<para>Fields are optional to support both traced and non-traced deployments.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>trace_id and span_id, if present, are globally unique identifiers </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>trace_id is shared across all operations in a trace </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>span_id is unique within a trace </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
